id=axion_recents
name=Axion Recents (Stacked Overview)
version=v1.1
versionCode=2
author=L3FeL
description=Stacked (deck-style) recents for Motorola Android 16. Boot-time tmpfs mirror of an AxionOS/Lawnchair-derived Launcher3 plus a static framework RRO that points config_recentsComponentName at it. Two modes: Axion as desktop + recents (default), or C-lite - the stock Moto launcher keeps HOME while Axion still serves the recents (needs the companion LSPosed helper shipped in extras/, see extras/C-LITE.md). Automatic HOME handover, crash-loop watchdog, one-flag rollback.
